        "question_id": "q-133802",
        "problem": "Aaron, Beatrice, and Chetna have each baked $2$ cherry pies and $3$ apple pies for the sale. In total, they baked\n\n                            \n                                    \n                            \n                                        {{field-1}}                \n                                    \n                                \n                                    \n                                        \n                                        \npies.",
        "status": "ambiguous",
        "answers": [
